        why: 'Alternating evaluation and improvement is policy iteration; see [David Silver’s official course](https://www.davidsilver.uk/teaching/). Choosing H here is only a fictional reward-model conclusion, not a recommendation to hold a real kiln setpoint or omit quality constraints and gates.',
