      feedback: ['Residual compares successive calculations. Error from the unknown true value also includes later changes and needs the contraction bound.', 'Correct: δ/(1−γ)=0.2 under the exact finite discounted-model conditions. It does not directly apply to arbitrary neural training.', 'Two sweeps propagate only finitely many layers of future reward and usually do not solve the fixed point exactly. Required iterations depend on the model and discount.'],
