        example: 'For current Q(S_t,A_t)=2 and α=0.1, the new value is 2+0.1×(1.9−2)=1.99. Positive immediate reward still leads to a slight downward update because the total target is below 2.',
        why: 'This concretely defines on-policy: the behavior supplying data is also the behavior evaluated. It does not mean inherently conservative or always safe; that behavior can itself incur substantial cost.',
